# Google Maps Platform API Key (never commit real keys to version control)
#
# Quickstart — Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping Only):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card or Cloud project required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click to generate/reveal your Demo Key.
# 5. Copy the key and paste it into a local `.env` file as GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY.
#    Note: Maps Demo Keys have daily quota limits and are for prototyping only.
#
# Production Setup:
# - Create a restricted API key in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# - Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), and Routes API.
# - Restrict your key per:
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
